[1mTest design.[22m Everything goes through [38;5;10mlibloading[0m on both [38;5;10m.so[0m files — no direct Rust calls — so the [38;5;10m#[unsafe(no_mangle)][0m wrappers are on the hot path. Since [38;5;10mgotomach[0m is observable through [38;5;10mprintf[0m as well as its return value, each comparison also captures file descriptor 1 (which both libraries share, via glibc's [38;5;10mstdout[0m) by [38;5;10mdup2[0m-ing it to a temp file and [38;5;10mfflush(NULL)[0m-ing, then asserts the captured bytes are equal. Tests are layered: symbols, then the three leaf operations, then [38;5;10mgotomach[0m, then exact stdout literals per log branch, then exhaustive sweeps.[0m[0m
